"""
UK COVID-19 SIRS Modeling Full Pipeline
========================================
Steps 1–9  : Data cleaning, aggregation, smoothing, visualisation
Steps 10–12: ODE baseline + PINN (constant β) + forward simulation
Step  13   : Piecewise β(t) with K = 4, 6, 8 + model selection

Data source : JHU time_series_covid19_confirmed_global.csv
Output      : uk_weekly_cases_clean.csv  +  all PNG charts
Confirmed   : T = 163 weeks (2020-01-27 → 2023-03-06)

Dependencies: numpy, pandas, scipy, matplotlib
"""

